      COMMON /SBETA/       JFIG10(121), JFIG11(121), JFIG12(121)
      COMMON /BDATA/       JFIG13(121), JFIG14(121), JFIG15(121),
     1                     JFIG16(121), JFIG17(121)
      COMMON /WHWB/        JFIG18(121)
