C ===== m13o15.f =====
      SUBROUTINE M13O15
C
C***  EXEC FOR OVERLAY 13, PROPELLER POWER EFFECTS
C
      COMMON /OVERLY/ NLOG,NMACH,I,NALPHA,IG,IJKDUM(3),NOVLY
      COMMON /IPOWER/ PP, POWER(200)
      COMMON /CONSNT/ PI,DEG,UNUSED,RAD
